  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy Fund 2011-2013 - ITP Courses</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Consultancy Fund 2011-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultfonden &#xe4;r en fond f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d relaterad till svenskfinansierade   program eller till bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet i Ksmbodia generellt. Varje   speciellt st&#xf6;d registreras som en separat komponent baserad p&#xe5; ett    s&#xe4;rskilt beslut. Alla beslut m&#xe5;ste godk&#xe4;nnas av den kambodjanska      partnern, CRDB/CDC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consultancy Fund is a fund for support related to Swedish funded  programs or to aid effectiveness in Cambodia in general. Every        specific support is registered as a separate component based on a     separate decision. All decisions must be approved by the Cambodian    partner, CRDB/CDC.</narrative>
  </description>
